msgstr ""

#: configdialog.cpp:422
msgid ""
"<qt>This lets you specify windows in which klipper should"
"<br>not invoke \"actions\". Use"
"<center><b>xprop | grep WM_CLASS</b></center>in a terminal to find out the "
"WM_CLASS of a window."
"<br>Next, click on the window you want to examine. The"
"<br>first string it outputs after the equal sign is the one"
"<br>you need to enter here.</qt>"
msgstr ""

